{# obs_names / var_names preview block.

   Inputs:
   - obs_preview (Markup): pre-escaped comma-separated preview of obs_names
     (format_index_preview already escapes each item).
   - var_preview (Markup): same for var_names.

   Role: produce the two-line `<div class="anndata-header__index">` block.
#}
<div class="anndata-header__index">
  <div><strong>obs_names:</strong> {{ obs_preview }}</div>
  <div><strong>var_names:</strong> {{ var_preview }}</div>
</div>
